## 🔑 Key Features

### 1. 👁️ Real-Time Behavioral Guardrails & XAI Audit
- **Explainable AI (XAI) Parsing:** Evaluates agent reasoning paths before tool or API execution.
- **Goal Drift & Anomaly Detection:** Intercepts vector embeddings and output tokens to detect deviations from the system instructions.
- **Scope & Privilege Enforcement:** Prevents agents from modifying system files, accessing unauthorized environment variables, or executing dangerous shell scripts.

### 2. ⚡ Autonomous "Gatekeeper" Sentinel Agent
- Runs on an isolated, lightweight LLM layer trained strictly on safety constraints and policy enforcement.
- Evaluates inputs and outputs in parallel without introducing significant latency to the main agent loop.

### 3. 🚨 On-Chain Emergency Kill-Switch (`AIGuardian.sol`)
- Smart contract layer that tracks agent heartbeat and behavioral compliance metrics.
- In case of critical failure or unauthorized boundary breach, the smart contract automatically triggers an immutable **Kill-Switch**, revoking the agent's API keys and access tokens.

### 4. 🔗 Immutable On-Chain Audit Log
- All decision hashes, system prompts, and safety verifications are hashed and stored on a decentralized ledger (EVM / Polygon / Arbitrum / Solana).
- Ensures that no autonomous agent can modify, delete, or obscure its own execution history.

